      "heading": "Tots in Tow",
      "level": 3,
      "markdown": "Increase your activity with New Parent Support Program **Tots in Tow** -- a walking group for parents with kids ages 0-5 years old.\n\nWith or without strollers.\n\nOlder siblings are welcome.\n\nWednesday mornings at Butler Stadium Track. Subject to change depending on weather and other NPSP events.\n\nFree and no registration required."
